:: Street Approach Widgets [widget]

<<widget "streetapproach">>
	<<set $approach_resist to 1>><<set $street_passage to $passage>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $NPCList[0].skills.security += (1000 - $submissive) / 4>>

	<span class="purple">Suddenly, a <<person>> approaches.</span><br>
	<<cheesy-pickup-line>>
	<br><br>

	<<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000 "silent">><<set _hasPromiscuity to 0>>
    <<if hasSexStat("promiscuity",2)>>
        <<set _hasPromiscuity to 1>>
        <<link [[Smile (0:10)|Street Approach Flirt]]>><<pass 10>><<handheldon>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
    <<else>>
        <span class="blue">You're not promiscuous enough to reciprocate.</span>
    <</if>>
    <br>
	<<if (($arousal lt $arousalmax * 3/5 or $arousalDesensitizedTrait is 1 or (typeof activeInsanityTrait === "function" and activeInsanityTrait())) and effectiveDrunk() lt 240) or !_hasPromiscuity>>
		<<link [[Reject (0:01)|Street Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<<elseif $willpowerSuccess>>
		<<link [[Reject (0:01)|Street Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 1>><<willpowersuccess>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $approach_resist to 0>>
		<span class="lewd">You're too <<= (!($arousalDesensitizedTrait is 1) and !(typeof activeInsanityTrait === "function" and activeInsanityTrait()) and $arousal gte $arousalmax * 3/5)? "horny" : "drunk">> to resist <<his>> advances.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

:: Street Approach Flirt
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<promiscuity2>>
You smile to <<his>> approach, encouraging <<him>> to continue. 
<br><br>

<<chitchat>> You both chat along on the street for a few minutes, happily enjoying eachothers company. 
<br><br>

"You know, you really are quite a <<= $player.gender_appearance is "f" ? ["sexy chick", "hot girl", "hot babe", "sex bomb", "sweet piece of tail"].random() : ["handsome guy", "sexy hunk of ass", "hot stud", "stallion"].random()>>," <<he>> leans forward, lending a flirty touch on your <<=$player.sex is "f"?"waist":"chest">> "<<= $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500? "" : "H-">>How about going somewhere more... private?" 
<br><br>

<<switch $speech_attitude>>
<<case "meek">>
	"S-Sure..." you meekly respond while contemplating in your mind the extent of the depravity about to befall your poor little self. Despite the countless lewd fantasies rapidly coursing through your head, or perhaps precisely because of them, you decide to follow <<him>> into the nearby alley.
<<case "bratty">>
	"We better get going, then," you respond, drawing a cheeky smile. "This <<= $player.gender_appearance is "f" ? "girl" : ($player.gender_appearance is "m" ? "boy" : "person") >> isn't gonna service <<pherself stranger>>." The <<person>> is stunned for a few moments before your sudden boldness. So after shaking off <<his>> very apparent shock, and quite against <<his>> better judgement, <<he>> follows you into the nearby alley.
<<default>>
	"I thought you'd never ask," you say while mockingly faking surprise. "Come on, let's go." There isn't much to think about, so you just follow <<him>> into the nearby alley.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Street Approach Flirt 2]]>><</link>>

:: Street Approach Flirt 2

<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500>>
	With implicit confidence, <<he>> guides you deeper into the alley to a spot were you both feel you'd be out of sight.
	No longer able to restrain <<himself>>, the <<person>> lunges at you, and begins to grope you all over.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next (0:10)|Street Approach Sex]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	With clear awkwardness, <<he>> discreetly looks around the alley and the surrounding streets, caringly searching for a spot where you'll both be obfuscated. Once <<he>> manages to find a spot <<he>> feels is safe enough, <<he>> beckons you over.
    <br><br>
	No longer able to control <<himself>>, the <<person>> lunges at you, cornering you against a wall. And begins to grope you all over with panting lust.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next (0:10)|Street Approach Sex]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Street Approach Sex

